# RealPlayer at real.com

> RealPlayer is a video player and downloader for Windows and mobile devices. Download videos from YouTube, TikTok, Facebook, Instagram, Vimeo and thousands of other sites with one click. Organize your library by people using facial recognition, sync across devices, and stream to your TV with Chromecast.

Important notes:

- RealPlayer for Windows is the main application; RealPlayer Mobile is the companion iOS and Android app
- Download functionality requires purchase of RealPlayer Plus or Downloader Express (free tier available)
- Video organization by people uses AI-powered facial recognition on your local machine
- StarSearch is a separate browser extension for celebrity identification in videos

## Products

- [RealPlayer for Windows](/realplayer): Feature-rich media player with video downloading, organization, and playback
- [RealPlayer Mobile](/realplayer-mobile): iOS and Android app for syncing and accessing your video library on the go
- [RealTimes](/realtimes): Create and share beautiful stories automatically from your photos and videos
- [Stories](/stories): Discover inspiration for creating, editing, and sharing your visual content
- [StarSearch](/starsearch): Browser extension to identify celebrities in videos with one click

